# Candidate A: every target, at about one minute a target
# (docs/FUZZ_EVALUATION.md, section 12). The same four workers, wall
# clock and sanitizer rule as pr-b.plan.
#
#   <worker> <target> <weight> <sanitizer>
wall 120
reserve 15
1 differential 60 none
1 structured 60 none
2 ir 60 none
2 ir_mutate 60 none
3 differential_source 60 none
3 run 60 address
4 image 40 address
4 parse 40 address
4 compile 40 address
